Laksana dipahat, digosok' itulah cara membina dirinya. Betapa teliti dan tekun' itulah cara meluruskan hatinya. 'Betapa terang dan mulia' itulah yang menyebabkan orang hormat kepadanya, dan 'Adalah seorang Junzi - Kuncu yang senantiasa tak boleh dilupakan' itulah melukiskan Jalan Suci yang jaya dan Kebajikan yang mencapai puncak kebaikan, maka rakyat tidak dapat melupakannya. (I.5.1.1)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.04.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"type":"text","value":"《"},{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"》"},{"pinyin":"yún","traditional":"云","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"戏","pinyin":"xì","traditional":"戲","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qián","traditional":"前","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wáng","traditional":"王","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wàng","traditional":"忘","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"！”"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贤","pinyin":"xián","traditional":"賢","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贤","pinyin":"xián","traditional":"賢","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"亲","pinyin":"qīn","traditional":"親","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"亲","pinyin":"qīn","traditional":"親","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xiǎo","traditional":"小","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"乐","pinyin":"lè","traditional":"樂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"乐","pinyin":"lè","traditional":"樂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"利","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin